<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f0f4f0; padding: 20px; margin: 0; }
    .container { background: #ffffff; padding: 32px; border-radius: 10px; max-width: 620px; margin: auto; }
    .header { text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid #e0e0e0; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .logo { max-width: 140px; }
    h2 { color: #1b5e20; font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
    .period { color: #777; font-size: 13px; margin: 0; }


    .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .stat-card { border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 10px; text-align: center; }
    .stat-pos { background: #e8f5e9; }
    .stat-neu { background: #fff8e1; }
    .stat-neg { background: #ffebee; }
    .stat-number { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0; }
    .stat-pos .stat-number { color: #2e7d32; }
    .stat-neu .stat-number { color: #f57c00; }
    .stat-neg .stat-number { color: #c62828; }
    .stat-label { font-size: 12px; color: #555; margin: 4px 0 0; }
    .stat-pct { font-size: 11px; color: #888; }


    .summary-row { display: flex; gap: 16px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .summary-item { flex: 1; background: #f5f5f5; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; }
    .summary-item .label { font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin: 0; }
    .summary-item .value { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #333; margin: 4px 0 0; }


    .ai-section { background: #f3f8f3; border-left: 4px solid #2e7d32; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; margin: 20px 0; }
    .ai-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; color: #2e7d32; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .ai-content { font-size: 14px; color: #333; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }

    .footer { text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: #aaa; margin-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 14px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      {{#if logoUrl}}
        <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="EcoVida" class="logo">
      {{else}}
        <h2 style="color:#2e7d32">EcoVida</h2>
      {{/if}}
      <h2>Reporte semanal de reseñas</h2>
      <p class="period">{{businessName}} &mdash; {{weekStartStr}} al {{weekEndStr}}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card stat-pos">
        <p class="stat-number">{{stats.positive}}</p>
        <p class="stat-label">Positivas</p>
        <p class="stat-pct">{{stats.pctPos}}%</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card stat-neu">
        <p class="stat-number">{{stats.neutral}}</p>
        <p class="stat-label">Neutrales</p>
        <p class="stat-pct">{{stats.pctNeu}}%</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card stat-neg">
        <p class="stat-number">{{stats.negative}}</p>
        <p class="stat-label">Negativas</p>
        <p class="stat-pct">{{stats.pctNeg}}%</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="summary-row">
      <div class="summary-item">
        <p class="label">Total esta semana</p>
        <p class="value">{{stats.total}} reseñas</p>
      </div>
      <div class="summary-item">
        <p class="label">Calificación promedio</p>
        <p class="value">{{stats.averageRating}} ★</p>
      </div>
      <div class="summary-item">
        <p class="label">Tendencia</p>
        <p class="value" style="color: {{trendColor}}">{{trendLabel}}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-section">
      <p class="ai-label">✦ Análisis generado por IA</p>
      <p class="ai-content">{{{aiSummaryHtml}}}</p>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size:13px; color:#555; line-height:1.6;">
      Accede a tu panel en EcoVida para ver el detalle completo de cada reseña
      y gestionar las respuestas a tus clientes.
    </p>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>Este reporte es generado automáticamente cada lunes por EcoVida.<br>
      Por favor no respondas a este correo.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
